    <node id="&quot;SIR WILLIAM JOHNSTONE RITCHIE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Sir William Johnstone Ritchie was a great-uncle of Roland Ritchie and served as a puisne justice and the second Chief Justice of Canada."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0039-82a6c1e3b474</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CHARLES RITCHIE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Charles Ritchie was a brother of Roland Ritchie and an important Canadian diplomat and diarist."</data>
